Tab bar (tab-bar)
Copyright jd-solanki

This mod is derived from the `tabs` mod, version 0.1.11, shipped with the Herdr app
(https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app), Copyright the Herdr authors, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modified by jd-solanki. Changes from the original:

- After Files and Changes, it shows the buttons other mods declare in the `button` field of
  their own `mod.json`; `props.buttons` on its layout block picks and orders them.
- A declared button toggles the mod's side panel when the layout has one, else goes to the
  space's tab showing that mod or opens one; `tab-bar.<mod>` keys press it.
- An unnamed tab shows its agent's own title, and a tab named `#<number>` takes that GitHub
  issue's or pull request's title, looked up with `gh`.
- JSDoc types for checking against Herdr's type files.
